@@ BE8 | Hybrid
Since the office building was planned, demand in the area has shifted from offices to housing because of remote working. What should the project manager do?
A) Reassess the business case and the building's mix of uses with the sponsor
B) Continue building offices, since the design has already been approved
C) Stop the project immediately and sell the land as soon as possible
D) Ask the sales team to find office tenants, whatever discounts are needed to fill the building
= A
