@@ BE8 | Hybrid
The regulator introduces an accelerated approval pathway for drugs like the team's. What should the project manager do?
A) Assess whether the drug is eligible and how the pathway would change the plan
B) Continue with the standard pathway, since it was planned at the start
C) Apply for the accelerated pathway at once, without any assessment
