@@ BE8 | Predictive
Several subcontractors are in financial difficulty because of an economic downturn. What should the project manager do?
A) Monitor their finances, identify alternatives and consider protections such as bonds
B) Pay the subcontractors in advance to help them through their difficulties
C) Terminate all of the subcontracts now, before any of the subcontractors fail
